--- a-priori decay: adding a nonzero coord multiplies |𝒲̂| bound by <= (7/6)/pi ---
    (7/6)/pi = 0.3714 < 1  (geometric in # nonzero coords)
    |𝒲̂(n)| <= (6/7)^{k-1-r} prod_{n_i!=0} 1/(pi|n_i|) * min(6/7, 1/(pi|sigma|)); =0 if 7|n_i or 7|sigma
